   "sql": "RESET enable_indexscan;\nRESET enable_bitmapscan;\nEXPLAIN (ANALYZE, COSTS OFF, TIMING OFF, SUMMARY OFF)\nSELECT c.name, o.id FROM customers AS c JOIN orders AS o ON o.customer_id = c.id WHERE c.city = 'Paris'",
   "note": "indexes back on: each order is one lookup in customers_pkey, 10,000 of them.",
